<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="am">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>የሴሚናር ጥሪ - LIBAM Management & Consultancy</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+Ethiopic:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Ethiopic:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #120c17;
            --bg-deep: #0a070d;
            --surface: #1c1522;
            --surface-soft: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --gold: #cda05a;
            --gold-bright: #ecc985;
            --gold-dim: rgba(205, 160, 90, 0.35);
            --teal: #2c5a63;
            --teal-bright: #6fb3ae;
            --teal-dim: rgba(44, 90, 99, 0.4);
            --cream: #f3ead9;
            --muted: #a99a8e;
            --hairline: rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.16);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans Ethiopic', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--cream);
            line-height: 1.8;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.10) 0%, transparent 42%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 70%, rgba(44, 90, 99, 0.22) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 55%, rgba(44, 90, 99, 0.14) 0%, transparent 40%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-deep) 0%, var(--bg) 15%, var(--bg) 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* Header / Logo */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 36px 0 8px 0;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 190px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.25));
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .logo:hover {
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .eyebrow {
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Iceberg signature */
        .signature {
            position: relative;
            margin: 18px auto 8px auto;
            max-width: 420px;
        }

        .signature svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

        /* Main Hero Card */
        .hero-card {
            background: linear-gradient(165deg, var(--surface), #150f1a 65%);
            border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
            border-radius: 22px;
            padding: 42px 36px;
            margin: 22px 0 28px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 36px; right: 36px;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-dim), transparent);
        }

        .headline {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif Ethiopic', serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--cream) 60%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            margin-bottom: 26px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #e7dcc9;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.12), rgba(44, 90, 99, 0.18));
            border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 20px 22px;
            border-radius: 4px 14px 14px 4px;
            margin: 26px 0;
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--cream);
        }

        .theory-box {
            background: rgba(10, 7, 13, 0.5);
            border: 1px dashed var(--teal-dim);
            padding: 20px 22px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin: 26px 0;
            color: #cfc3b6;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
        }

        /* Benefits Section */
        .benefits-section {
            margin: 38px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif Ethiopic', serif;
            font-size: 1.28rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .benefits-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .benefits-list li {
            background: var(--surface-soft);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 13px;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .benefits-list li:hover {
            background: rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.06);
            border-color: var(--gold-dim);
            transform: translateX(3px);
        }

        .bullet-node {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 9px;
            height: 9px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.5);
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* Gift Offer Banner */
        .offer-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.16), rgba(44, 90, 99, 0.3));
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px 24px;
            margin: 36px 0;
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--cream);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.08);
        }

        /* Schedule */
        .schedule-card {
            background: var(--bg-deep);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 28px 26px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }

        .schedule-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 11px 0 11px 14px;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-dim);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 1.02rem;
        }

        .schedule-item:last-of-type {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .info-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(111, 179, 174, 0.12);
            color: var(--teal-bright);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.96rem;
            margin-top: 16px;
            margin-right: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(111, 179, 174, 0.25);
        }

        /* Instructor */
        .instructor-box {
            background: rgba(10, 7, 13, 0.65);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 22px;
            margin: 26px 0;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--teal-bright);
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            color: #e2d8c9;
        }

        /* CTA */
        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 42px 0 20px 0;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #a97c3c);
            color: #1a1207;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 18px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -8px rgba(205, 160, 90, 0.5),
                        0 0 18px rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.25);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 34px -8px rgba(205, 160, 90, 0.65),
                        0 0 26px rgba(236, 201, 133, 0.4);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-bright), #b98944);
        }

        .urgency-text {
            color: var(--teal-bright);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 18px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .closing-text {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Noto Serif Ethiopic', serif;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            margin-top: 32px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 28px 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            margin-top: 36px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 640px) {
            .benefits-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero-card { padding: 26px 20px; }
            .headline { font-size: 1.3rem; }
            .cta-btn { font-size: 1.02rem; padding: 16px 20px; width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Logo Header -->
        <header>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="LIBAM Management & Consultancy Logo" class="logo">
            <div class="eyebrow">LIBAM Management &amp; Consultancy</div>
        </header>

        <!-- Iceberg signature: one connected mass, split at the waterline into
             the visible tip (conscious mind) and the submerged bulk (subconscious mind) -->
        <div class="signature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="የበረዶ ግግር ምስል — የላይኛው ጫፍ ንቁ አእምሮን፣ የውሃ ውስጡ ደግሞ ድብቅ አእምሮን ይወክላል">
                <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="tipGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f3ead9"/>
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#cda05a"/>
                    </linearGradient>
                    <linearGradient id="bodyGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3c7079" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#132226" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
                    </linearGradient>
                    <linearGradient id="waterGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#6fb3ae" stop-opacity="0.35"/>
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6fb3ae" stop-opacity="0"/>
                    </linearGradient>
                    <!-- single connected iceberg outline -->
                    <clipPath id="icebergClip">
                        <polygon points="200,25 235,112 300,132 355,225 250,255 150,255 45,225 100,132 165,112"/>
                    </clipPath>
                </defs>

                <!-- deep water glow -->
                <rect x="0" y="112" width="400" height="148" fill="url(#waterGrad)"/>

                <!-- the whole iceberg, one shape, colored above/below the waterline -->
                <g clip-path="url(#icebergClip)">
                    <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="112" fill="url(#tipGrad)"/>
                    <rect x="0" y="112" width="400" height="148" fill="url(#bodyGrad)"/>
                </g>
                <polygon points="200,25 235,112 300,132 355,225 250,255 150,255 45,225 100,132 165,112"
                         fill="none" stroke="#6fb3ae" stroke-opacity="0.3" stroke-width="1"/>

                <!-- waterline -->
                <path d="M0,112 Q50,104 100,112 T200,112 T300,112 T400,112"
                      fill="none" stroke="#ecc985" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.6"/>

                <!-- labels placed directly on their region -->
                <text x="200" y="14" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600"
                      font-family="'Noto Sans Ethiopic', sans-serif" fill="#ecc985">ንቁ አእምሮ</text>
                <text x="200" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="600"
                      font-family="'Noto Sans Ethiopic', sans-serif" fill="#8fc9c4">ድብቅ አእምሮ</text>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content Box -->
        <div class="hero-card">

            <div class="headline">
                🎯 የሰዎችን አእምሮ የመረዳት እና የመግባባት ጥበብን ማወቅ ይፈልጋሉ?
            </div>

            <div class="intro-text">
                በማንኛውም የ እድሜ ክልል  ለሚገኙ ነጋዴዎች፣ መሪዎች, የሽያጭ ባለሙያዎች፣ ተማሪዎች፣ ጓደኛሞች፣ ፍቅረኛሞች፣ ባለትዳሮች እና ሰራተኞች በ አጠቃላይ መልካም ተግባቦት መፍጠር፣ ሰዎችን ማሳመን፣ ሰዎች ላይ ተፅዕኖ መፍጠር አስፈላጊ እንደሆነ ለሚያምን  ሁሉ የተዘጋጀ ልዩ የሴሚናር ጥሪ!
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                የራስዎንና የሌሎች ሰዎችን የግንዛቤ መንገድ በጥልቀት በመረዳት ህይወትዎን እና ግንኙነትዎን  በከፍተኛ ደረጃ ያሻሽሉ!
            </div>

            <div class="theory-box">
                ይህ ሴሚናር የተለመደ አይነት ቲዮሪ አይደለም፤ ራስዎን በጥልቅ መረዳት፣ የሌሎች ሰዎችን ስሜት መተርጎም እና ጠንካራ ግንኙነቶችን መገንባት የሚማሩበት ልዩ የተግባር ሴሚናር ነው::
            </div>

            <!-- Benefits -->
            <div class="benefits-section">
                <div class="section-title">
                    ይህን ሴሚናር በመሳተፍ ምን ያተርፋሉ?
                </div>
                <ul class="benefits-list">
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>የራስዎንና የሌሎች ሰዎችን የግንዛቤ መንገድ (Mental representation system) በጥልቅ ይረዳሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>ከሌሎች ጋር በመተማመን ላይ የተመሰረተ ግንኙነት መፍጠር ይማራሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>የሰዎችን ባህሪ የሚገፉ ውስጣዊ አንቀሳቃሽ ኃይሎችን ይረዳሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>የሰዎችን የሰውነት ቋንቋ (Body language) ማንበብ ይጀምራሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>ሰዎች ሆን ብለውና (Concious) ሳያስቡት (Subconcious) የሚያስተላልፉትን መልዕክት ይረዳሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>ሰዎችን የማሳመንና ተፅዕኖ የማሳረፍ ብቃትዎን ከፍ ያደርጋሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>የሌሎች ሰዎች ንቁ አዕምሮ ብቻ ሳይሆን ድብቅ አእምሮ ጋር መግባባት ይማራሉ</div></li>
                    <li><span class="bullet-node"></span> <div>ግንኙነቶችዎን ከፍ ወዳለ ደረጃ የሚያደርሱ ልዩ እይታዎችን ይማራሉ</div></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Gift Offer -->
            <div class="offer-banner">
                🎁አዲሱን አመት በስጦታ ልንጀምረው ወስነናል፣ ከዚህ በፊት ተሳታፊዎች እስከ 3,000 (ሶስት ሺ) ብር የከፈሉበትን ስልጠና በማኪያቶ ዋጋ ብቻ አቅርበናል!
            </div>

            <!-- Schedule -->
            <div class="schedule-card">
                <div class="section-title">
                    📌 የ5 ቀን የቴሌግራም ሴሚናር ፕሮግራም:
                </div>
                <div class="schedule-item">🗓 ማክሰኞ መስከረም 19, 2019 (Sept 29, 2026)</div>
                <div class="schedule-item">🗓 አርብ መስከረም 22, 2019 (Oct 02, 2026)</div>
                <div class="schedule-item">🗓 ማክሰኞ መስከረም 26, 2019 (Oct 06, 2026)</div>
                <div class="schedule-item">🗓 አርብ መስከረም 29, 2019 (Oct 09, 2026)</div>
                <div class="schedule-item">🗓 ማክሰኞ ጥቅምት 3, 2019 (Oct 13, 2026)</div>

                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <div class="info-pill">⏰ ሰዓት: ከምሽቱ 2:30 - 4:30</div>
                    <div class="info-pill">📍 ቦታ: ኦንላይን በቴሌግራም</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Instructor -->
            <div class="instructor-box">
                ስልጠናው የረጅም ግዜ ልምድ ባላቸው የኒውሮሊንጉዊስቲክ ፕሮግራሚንግ ባለሙያ ዳንኤል አያሌው ይሰጣል
            </div>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <div class="cta-container">
                <a href="https://t.me/+rSrDGNFyHHJmMTFk" target="_blank" class="cta-btn">
                    📞 አሁኑኑ ቦታ ለማስያዝ ወደዚህ ቴሌግራም ግሩፕ ይቀላቀሉ መረጃ እንዲደርስዎ "ራፖር" ብለው መልእክት ያስቀምጡ https://t.me/+rSrDGNFyHHJmMTFk :👉
                </a>
                <div class="urgency-text">
                    ያለን ቦታ ውስን ስለሆነ ቀድመው ይመዝገቡ!
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="closing-text">
                ልባም ቀን! 🙏
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            © LIBAM Management & Consultancy
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
